%% Use Case 2: Create or Join Group, create path (Requirements_and_Design.md section 4.6)
sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Member
    participant FE as Front-end
    participant UG as Users & Groups
    participant DB as MongoDB

    M->>FE: tap "Create group"
    FE-->>M: group name form ("Create" disabled while the name is blank)
    M->>FE: enter group name, tap "Create"
    FE->>UG: POST /api/groups {name} + session token
    alt device cannot reach the server
        FE-->>M: "Network error: ..." (stays on the form)
    else name longer than 60 characters
        UG-->>FE: 400 "Invalid request: name must be a non-empty string of at most 60 characters"
        FE-->>M: show error, member edits the name
    else valid name
        loop until the generated invite code is unique
            UG->>UG: generate 6-character invite code
            UG->>DB: insert group {name, inviteCode, organizer and only member = caller}
        end
        UG-->>FE: 201 Group {id, inviteCode}
        FE->>UG: GET /api/groups/:groupId
        UG->>UG: requireMembership(groupId, userId)
        UG->>DB: load group and member names
        UG-->>FE: 200 GroupDetail
        FE->>UG: GET /api/groups/:groupId/meetups
        UG-->>FE: 200 List of Meetup
        FE-->>M: group page with name, invite code and member list
    end
